  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Online Chuch-Based Development Leadership Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to strengthen the leadership of FHCM and enable the leadership to keep and develop the organisation, and also to strengthen the abilities to lift up a poor and vulnerable society.

The participants are two young ladies who both grew up in FHCM. One of them works as a teacher in their school.  The other works as a school secretary. They both serve in the local church.

Main activities of the intervention will be teaching and group discussions.

We expect the two ladies to:
1) Become role models for their younger sisters in the children&#xb4;s home.
2) Take responsibility for local development activities.
3) Become strong, independant and focused employees in FHCM and keep FHCM being a strong organisation in the future.
4) Help the organisation to make a stronger impact on the society by empowering children, youth and staff members. 
5) Become advocates for the Sustainable Develpment Goals and diaconal work.</narrative>
  </description>
